# model-cards/

This folder holds one `<model_name>.md` file per trained weight in the system. Each is EU AI Act Article 11 (Annex IV) technical-documentation evidence.

Shape (per file, written by the stage that trains the model):

```markdown
# Model card: <name>

- **Intended use**: <what this model does, what it does not do>
- **Architecture**: <class name, file path>
- **Training data**: <dataset name(s), source URL, license, SHA256, DVC pointer>
- **Training command**: <exact command + git SHA at training time>
- **Hyperparameters**: <list>
- **Eval metrics**: <metric: value, with test-set provenance>
- **Known limitations**: <where the model is known to underperform>
- **Out-of-distribution behavior**: <what happens on inputs outside training distribution>
- **Bias / fairness assessment**: <if applicable to use case>
- **Robustness**: <adversarial robustness, input perturbation studies>
- **Last retrained**: <date>
- **Drift monitor**: <metric being monitored, threshold, alert channel>
```

Stages 4–9 each add one or more model cards as their training runs complete. CI rejects merging a new `*.pt` / `*.pth` / `*.onnx` weight under `weights/` without a sibling model card in this folder.
